Middleware chain built in a loop, stored in a map, called dynamically. Business routes are
Recover(MapErrors(Translate)(Deadline(Auth(h)))), /health is the bare swallow-all handler.
Expect *api.Error (404 no route + Translate's 400/404/402/500), api.ErrUnavailable, ErrDuplicate behind
(*api.Error).Unwrap, and Recover's opaque "middleware: panic serving %s: %v". middleware.ErrUnauthorized and
Deadline's ctx errors must NOT appear untranslated (they pass through MapErrors(Translate)).
-- args --
-fanout=2 api/api.go:@serve
